FlowTime, rebuilt from scratch:
- The timer keeps counting with the app closed, with a notification and an alert at the end of each phase.
- Widget, quick settings tile and daily reminder.
- Tasks and tags for each session.
- Daily goal, streak and new stats.
- Sounds that play in the background, with mixes and a sleep timer.
- Dark mode, new themes, tablets and backups.
- New FlowTime Pro, one payment. Without Pro: 15 pending tasks, 4 tags and 3 mixes at a time. Nothing is deleted.
